1
00:00:00,879 --> 00:00:05,379
Are you expecting an example
involving a real-life time machine?

2
00:00:07,218 --> 00:00:09,178
(Sheldon:)That's absurd.

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,010
LEONARD:
Come on, guys, push.

4
00:00:12,182 --> 00:00:16,682
HOWARD: If I push any harder,
I'm gonna give birth to my colon.

5
00:00:17,604 --> 00:00:19,144
- Oh, hey, guys.
- Hi, Penny.

6
00:00:19,314 --> 00:00:20,694
[RAJESH AND HOWARD SCREAM]

7
00:00:22,776 --> 00:00:24,656
(Leonard(letting go of time machine, as does Sheldon):)Take a break, guys.

8
00:00:25,361 --> 00:00:26,361
(Penny:)What are you doing?

9
00:00:26,529 --> 00:00:30,199
Oh, you know,
just moving a time machine.

10
00:00:30,992 --> 00:00:33,332
(Penny:)Yeah, okay, neat.
But I really gotta get to work.

11
00:00:33,495 --> 00:00:35,245
(Leonard:)No problem.

12
00:00:41,169 --> 00:00:42,749
(Leonard:)Hang on.

13
00:00:43,713 --> 00:00:45,633
But what about your time machine?

14
00:00:45,799 --> 00:00:48,889
(Leonard:)Some things are more important
than toys.

15
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,560
(Penny:)I'm scared.

16
00:00:58,728 --> 00:01:01,018
(Leonard:)Don't worry, baby, I've got you.

